391   D Compute and existing assets
392   Experiments were run on an Apple M4 Mac Mini with 16GB uniﬁed memory using MLX and MLX-
393   LM. The BF16 Qwen replication covers fewer conﬁgurations than the 4-bit cross-validation because
394   of this memory limit. The sustained-generation suite is also smaller because it recomputes full

                                                                13
395   donor and target traces at each generated step. The supplement’s per-run run_metadata.json ﬁles
396   record UTC start times, platform strings, model identiﬁers, layer and alpha grids, prompt counts,
397   and generation caps for the included runs.
398   The primary AIME 2026 answer-quality experiment contains 120 fresh generations under one equal
399   32,768-token cap, matching NVIDIA’s public model-card example (NVIDIA, 2025). We report
400   every cap hit without retrying it. This is a post-hoc corrective rerun: an earlier equal-cap run was
401   inspected ﬁrst and had truncated 65/120 responses at 8,192 tokens. The controller, tasks, prompts,
402   four conditions, sampling policies, seeds, grading, and uncertainty procedure were unchanged; only
403   the common cap changed. We preserve the earlier run as superseded resource-bounded provenance
404   rather than combining its rows with the primary analysis.
405   The model checkpoints are open Hugging Face assets: Qwen3.5-4B and Qwen3-4B are Apache-
406   2.0, OLMo 3 7B Think/Instruct is Apache-2.0 with Ai2 Responsible Use Guidelines, Gemma 4
407   E2B-it is documented by Google DeepMind with thinking-mode controls, LiquidAI LFM2.5 1.2B
408   uses the LFM Open License v1.0, Phi-4-mini-reasoning is MIT, and Llama-3.1-Nemotron-Nano-
409   4B-v1.1 uses the NVIDIA Open Model License with additional Llama 3.1 terms. The prompt-
410   boundary branch audits use math-ai/aime25 and math-ai/aime26, which are Apache-2.0 licensed on
411   their Hugging Face dataset pages. Public generation diagnostics are provided as behavior artifacts
412   for the same intervention family.

413   E Broader impacts
414   This work gives a concrete audit target for hybrid-reasoning systems: an activation measured before
415   generation is easier to test than a vague claim that thinking is on. The main dual-use risk is superﬁcial
416   manipulation of thinking-style behavior, so we pair the result with held-out tests and failures that
417   distinguish mode entry from answer quality.

418   F    Generated behavior diagnostics
419   F.1 Qwen3 template-matched one-token replication

420   The follow-through suite freezes every choice made by the 12-prompt localization audit, then
421   uses the next two authored instances from each of its six categories and templates. The result-
422   ing 12 prompts are disjoint from localization but category- and template-matched. This tests new
423   prompt values within the same authored structures, not broad-distribution transfer. Both modes keep
424   enable_thinking=True, use /think or /no_think, and receive the same supplied <think> to-
425   ken. The copied residual state is used only to choose the next argmax token at layer 24 for off-
426   to-think and layer 28 for think-to-off. We then delete every copied state, insert the selected token
427   into the untouched target context, and sample with temperature 0.6, top-p 0.95, and top-k 20. Each
428   prompt and direction uses three seeds with common random numbers across conditions. The design
429   reports 216 direction-labeled analysis rows. Because a canonical reference completion serves as the
430   donor in one direction and the target in the other, these rows correspond to 144 prompt/context/seed
431   generation conditions.

