440   F.2 Earlier Qwen generated-preﬁx diagnostics

441   Generated-preﬁx tests ask what happens after sampled tokens begin changing the next model state.
442   In a Qwen diagnostic, a vector is learned on 24 public prompts and evaluated on 40 disjoint
443   GSM8K/MATH-500 prompts. It is added for the ﬁrst generated decision and then for up to 64
444   later decisions before the model continues freely. The selected no-think-to-think vector changes
445   response style and performs favorably on this one held-out set; the reverse row shows that style
446   movement need not improve answers.

